<b>ROACH KILLER</b>

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:13.170
I sprayed pesticide, didn't I?

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:16.170
Yeah, after you locked it in my room.

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:19.170
