00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:25.140
Just admit you're scared of them.

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:32.280
Mom and Mineaki-san won't be home
 tonight because of the typhoon.

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:36.780
I don't wanna be alone when another 
one of those things pops out.

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:39.140
Even still...

00:03:39.980 --> 00:03:42.250
Do we have to sleep in the same bed?

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:43.700
Why not?

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:48.270
