<i>How long has it been since I
 was this close to your face?</i>

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:35.850
Ayai...

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:50.100
<i>I can't just erase the fact that we broke up.
That we became stepsiblings.</i>

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:53.340
