00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:08.840
Oh? You do, do you?

00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:11.700
It's your fault for being 
so pathetic in the first place.

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:14.170
Yeah, yeah. You've made your point.

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:19.770
You two are acting like a couple 
going through a rough patch.

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:24.470
Our relatives are gonna tease you even 
more when we go see them for Obon.

00:05:26.150 --> 00:05:28.300
This trip is starting 
to sound less appealing.

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:32.060
The Kyoto Times {Newspaper}

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:32.060
Pretty much all there is to do
 in my hometown is play in the river.

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:35.400
Make sure to pack your swimsuits, okay?

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:38.110
Pass. I'm just going to read
 like I normally do.

00:05:38.110 --> 00:05:40.230
I'll probably do the same.

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:43.310
Aw, but playing in the river's fun!

00:05:43.310 --> 00:05:45.290
Why don't you go buy a swimsuit, Yume?

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:46.700
And bring Mizuto-kun along!

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:48.530
B-But why?!

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:52.410
I mean, the only one you have 
is your school swimsuit, right?

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:55.820
Plus, you've gotten bigger recently, 
so it probably doesn't fit you anymore.

00:05:55.820 --> 00:05:57.410
Hey— Mom, please!

00:05:57.690 --> 00:06:01.920
Anyway, I was asking why
 I have to take Mizuto-kun.

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:05.240
What? You don't want him to tag along?

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:10.590
I, um... I didn't say that...

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:14.170
Then you two had better get going!

00:06:26.420 --> 00:06:27.500
Sorry for the wait.

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:30.730
Why are you wearing glasses?

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:32.810
I'm in disguise.

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:35.830
It'll be a pain if someone we 
know spots us while we're out.

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:37.430
Here. Wear this.

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:38.080
Hmm?

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:42.840
You've been getting more popular at school 
since taking the top score in our class.

00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:45.540
You'll be harder to spot with this on.

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:48.340
You're acting like we're celebrities.

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:51.950
Well, if you don't mind the onslaught 
of rumors about us dating

00:06:51.950 --> 00:06:53.880
when we go back to school,

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:55.850
then I suppose you don't have to wear it.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:06:59.400
Fine.

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:06.860
And these too.

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:08.110
Huh?

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:10.060
For your disguise.

00:07:10.060 --> 00:07:12.360
See? I'm wearing them too.

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:13.510
No thanks.

00:07:13.510 --> 00:07:14.830
Why not?!

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:16.600
You'd look cool...

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:32.780
Why am I even here?

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:33.760
Hey.

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:35.750
Hmm? What is it?

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:38.840
There's no one around, is there?

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:40.650
Nope.

00:07:40.650 --> 00:07:41.710
I see.

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:43.660
Could you just pick one already?

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:45.980
Could I show you?

00:07:46.760 --> 00:07:48.570
Show me? Show me what?

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:51.320
My swimsuit.

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:55.570
Wh-Why me?!

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:57.450
I can't decide, okay?!

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:59.840
This is my first time buying one for myself.

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:01.960
A-And you think <i>I </i>can help you?

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:04.330
I just want your input. Ready?

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:05.200
Wai—

00:08:14.850 --> 00:08:16.090
Well?

00:08:16.090 --> 00:08:17.700
Um...

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:21.600
I-It looks good on you... I think.

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:25.660
What was that? Don't you, you know...

00:08:26.850 --> 00:08:29.230
have more nice things to say?

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:30.730
Huh?

00:08:34.050 --> 00:08:35.740
You're asking that...

00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:40.240
like it's...

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:44.750
no big deal...

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:48.750
You're really devoted to your family, I guess.

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:49.980
Huh?

00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:52.010
Why bring that up?

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:53.610
What else can I say?!

00:08:53.610 --> 00:08:57.580
I can't just compliment
 how you look without... you know?

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:02.780
Y-You idiot!

00:09:02.780 --> 00:09:05.190
I didn't mean me! I m-meant the swimsuit!

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:07.190
Like if this color suits me at all!

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:09.940
Or if I look cute in this style!
That kind of thing!

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:12.360
Wait, huh? That's what you meant?

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:14.820
I n-never asked you to compliment <i>me</i>!

00:09:19.890 --> 00:09:21.450
I'll go with this one.

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:23.700
You like it?

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:27.850
Y-Yes, <i>I</i> like it. It's for <i>me</i>.

00:09:30.390 --> 00:09:35.340
I have to admit I've always appreciated how 
willing you are to keep someone company.

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:36.720
Why, thank you.

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:41.850
Although I had to for your sake today,
 Miss Family-Comes-First.

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:42.730
Huh?

00:09:43.920 --> 00:09:49.210
Dad suggested it. Then Yuni-san pushed 
for it, so you couldn't say no, right?

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:50.480
I guess not.

00:09:50.910 --> 00:09:55.450
It's a kid's job to assuage 
their parent's worries, after all.

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:57.770
That's an odd way of putting it.

00:09:58.400 --> 00:10:02.030
