00:10:14.690 --> 00:10:17.050
Haven't seen this place in a while, huh?

00:10:18.870 --> 00:10:19.990
I guess so.

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:07.990
Ouch!

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:10.520
