00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:23.990
Yeah, I thought you might like it.

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:26.550
Also, um...

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:27.960
Hmm?

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:33.080
