00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:40.080
Look at you two, acting so awkward.

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:43.930
Now you're like a couple working up 
the nerve to pop the question.

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:46.510
I remember when we got to that stage.

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:47.290
Right?

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:48.810
Oh, give me a break!

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:50.180
What do you want from us?!

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:52.490
You keep on commenting on our behavior,

00:11:52.490 --> 00:11:54.690
