00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:56.350
I'm sorry, honey.

00:11:56.350 --> 00:12:00.650
I'm just not used to seeing you get 
along so well with a boy, you know?

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:08.670
<i>Well, I guess the fact that they can 
joke about us being a couple</i>

00:12:08.670 --> 00:12:11.900
<i>means they genuinely regard us as siblings.</i>

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:16.040
<b>My Stepmom's Daughter Is My Ex</b>

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:21.300
<b>Irido</b>

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:31.810
<i>I don't mind watching the 
movie Higashira-san suggested...</i>

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:35.310
<i>But what's with that position?
 Why must she lie on his lap?</i>

