<i>You're kidding, right?!</i>

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:04.880
<i>I get it.</i>

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:07.050
<i>I know it gets all sweaty and itchy,</i>

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:09.810
<i>but you're just gonna scratch it?!
Like this?!</i>

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:11.740
<i>Just how comfortable are they?</i>

00:13:11.740 --> 00:13:12.810
<i></i>That's<i> what's going on.</i>

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:16.280
