It was interesting.

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:44.590
Which part?

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:49.430
The first thing that caught my eye 
was how they depicted the scenery.

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:52.510
But the structure of the narrative
 piqued my interest

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:55.310
