It felt like the director's fetishes 
were front and center in the details,

00:14:00.640 --> 00:14:05.440
but overall, the film had a
Hollywood-esque sophistication to it.

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:09.190
All that combined gave it 
an indescribable charm.

00:14:09.770 --> 00:14:12.580
