Why is this one masquerading 
as a mainstream feature?

00:14:28.360 --> 00:14:32.640
<i>I was too distracted with you to 
watch the movie, Higashira-san.</i>

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:34.860
I think it's awesome that a mainstream movie 
is openly flaunting such a blatant fetish!

00:14:34.860 --> 00:14:36.670
It is pretty amazing.

00:14:36.670 --> 00:14:40.080
I guess fetishes inevitably
 manifest in creative works.

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:43.450
It rules when you can 
read a creator like that.

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:46.220
You can't help but feel 
more in tune with them!

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:49.230
<i>Their conversations are nothing 
but gobbledygook to me.</i>

00:14:49.230 --> 00:14:52.030
I'm thirsty. Pour me some.

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:53.530
Yeah, yeah.

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:55.540
You all right with this cup?

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:57.810
I can't be bothered to go get another one.

00:14:57.810 --> 00:14:59.000
Sure.

00:15:03.940 --> 00:15:05.150
I'm beat.

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:07.710
You're tired after watching a two-hour movie?

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.280
Have you no stamina at all?

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:11.510
I rarely watch animated movies,

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:14.680
but this one really exceeded 
my expectations.

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:16.940
Hmm? What's wrong?

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:19.770
Um... Well...

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:26.270
That was an indirect kiss 
just now, wasn't it?

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:30.640
Huh? That's it?

00:15:30.640 --> 00:15:32.240
It doesn't faze you at all?

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:34.650
Is it just like that with family?

00:15:34.650 --> 00:15:37.540
Or is it normal for high schoolers?

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:42.870
Oh? You really are sleepy.

00:15:44.320 --> 00:15:46.460
Allow me to return the favor.

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:48.840
Now it's my turn to be the pillow.

00:15:50.150 --> 00:15:51.070
Okay, then...

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:52.810
Hold it right there! Stop, stop!

00:15:52.810 --> 00:15:54.050
You can't do that!

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:56.400
You just... You can't do that!

00:15:56.400 --> 00:15:57.550
Why not?

00:15:57.550 --> 00:15:58.800
Yeah, why not?

00:15:58.800 --> 00:16:00.560
I mean, you know...

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:03.450
You'd be lying on a genuine high 
school girl's lap, you know?

00:16:03.450 --> 00:16:06.690
My G-cups look pretty sweet from below too.

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:09.900
I could even clean your 
ears for you if you'd like.

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:13.780
A special offer for my <i>favorite</i> customer...

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:16.120
Could you not make it sound so suspicious?

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:19.380
Getting my ears cleaned by you sounds scary...

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:22.340
Huh?

00:16:25.780 --> 00:16:27.260
Does this mean

00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:31.980
he didn't like the idea of me cleaning 
his ears, so he went to you instead?

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:33.800
I guess.

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:36.300
Excuse me a minute.

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:39.420
Do I really seem that incompetent to you?

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:40.200
Yup.

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:43.310
I'm shocked!

00:16:44.680 --> 00:16:49.220
I guess you can't stay mad
 at that adorable sleeping face.

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:52.980
<i>She must really like him, huh?</i>

00:16:53.680 --> 00:16:54.960
Now that I'm here...

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:57.150
should I go ahead and clean his ears?

00:16:57.150 --> 00:16:59.600
Er, I don't think so.

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:03.180
Aren't you scared to go poking 
around in someone else's ear?

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:04.760
Ah, I feel that.

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:08.480
I was kind of scared 
when my mom did it for me.

00:17:08.480 --> 00:17:13.090
It's like, would you mind not 
snooping around in my ears?

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:15.880
Exactly.

00:17:16.560 --> 00:17:18.360
In that case, maybe I'll kiss him instead.

00:17:18.360 --> 00:17:19.450
Right...

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:21.010
Huh?

00:17:21.670 --> 00:17:22.920
Higashira-san?

00:17:22.920 --> 00:17:24.720
Did you say "kiss" just now?

00:17:24.720 --> 00:17:27.150
He'd be none the wiser if I did.

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:29.160
Wait, are you serious?

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:31.850
I'm right here, you know?

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:34.030
I guess so.

00:17:34.680 --> 00:17:38.090
Maybe I should wait for
 more favorable circumstances.

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:40.360
It'd be my first kiss, after all.

00:17:40.360 --> 00:17:42.490
Even more reason not to do it now.

00:17:42.860 --> 00:17:45.340
You should really treasure such things.

00:17:46.560 --> 00:17:51.000
But if there's anyone I want to 
do it with, it'd be Mizuto-kun.

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:54.480
I'm surprised you're able to restrain 
yourself while thinking that.

00:17:54.480 --> 00:17:57.220
I am trying my best to hold back, you know?

00:17:57.550 --> 00:18:03.060
I honestly feel like I'm gonna explode 
whenever he ruffles up my hair.

00:18:03.370 --> 00:18:06.140
I finally get what's going through
 a light novel heroine's head

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:07.810
when her cheeks get all flushed and red.

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:11.560
The all-ages version of a game is plenty fun,

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:15.780
but if you're gonna play, you'd rather
 have the 18+ original, you know?

00:18:16.290 --> 00:18:23.310
Since we're just buddies, there's only
 so much we can do together.

00:18:23.310 --> 00:18:24.910
That's just how it is.

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:30.500
Though adding a certain four-letter word 
before "buddies" <i>would</i> solve the problem...

00:18:31.550 --> 00:18:32.360
Hold it.

00:18:32.360 --> 00:18:35.590
If that's what you're going for,
 I can't support you.

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:37.720
Don't worry. I understand.

00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:41.470
Accepting a friend with benefits would be 
out-of-character behavior for Mizuto-kun.

00:18:42.150 --> 00:18:44.810
I thought you were trying 
to be coy with the wording...

00:18:46.690 --> 00:18:51.840
Getting to discuss this stuff with the 
hot model student is quite a turn-on.

00:18:51.840 --> 00:18:53.020
You're disgusting.

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:56.140
Well, I'm gonna head home now.

00:18:56.140 --> 00:18:57.560
O-Okay.

00:18:59.260 --> 00:19:03.240
It was a pleasure to unlock so many
 unique character images today.

00:19:03.520 --> 00:19:05.660
Like the one of Mizuto-kun's sleeping face.

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:07.620
And of him lying on
 his brother-obsessed sister.

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:09.750
I-I'm not obsessed!

00:19:25.860 --> 00:19:27.060
Irido-kun...

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:38.860
<i>I finally understand why you hesitated then.</i>

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:44.360
<i>When reminiscing about the past
 and longing to go back to how things were,</i>

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:46.500
<i>you start wishing to relive things together.</i>

00:19:46.970 --> 00:19:49.960
<i>But that's nothing more 
than lingering feelings.</i>

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:54.780
<i>And acting on those feelings isn't 
worth the destruction it would mean</i>

00:19:54.780 --> 00:19:55.880
<i>for our new life together.</i>

00:19:57.130 --> 00:20:00.240
<i>The fact that we broke up and the 
fact that we became stepsiblings...</i>

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:03.220
<i>Neither thing can be erased.</i>

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:06.390
<b>Irido</b>

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:09.350
Hey, hey! Yume!

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:11.270
What is it, Mom?

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:15.770
What's really going on between 
Higashira-san and Mizuto-kun?

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:18.020
What do you mean?

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:19.610
I mean, you know?

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:22.810
She's been coming over all the time,
 even though it's summer break.

00:20:22.810 --> 00:20:23.860
Oh...

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:26.400
I think they just enjoy each other's company.

00:20:26.400 --> 00:20:28.320
They really do, don't they?

00:20:28.320 --> 00:20:30.250
She <i>did</i> tell me she was his ex...

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:34.490
But maybe she's just hiding the fact 
that they're dating because she's shy!

00:20:34.490 --> 00:20:35.710
Who knows?

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:38.350
Well, they did watch another 
movie together today.

00:20:38.350 --> 00:20:39.500
My goodness!

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:40.910
And? What then?

00:20:40.910 --> 00:20:43.040
What do you mean? That's the end.

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:44.260
What?

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:47.680
Can't you, you know, give me any details?

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:49.300
Like, did anything happen?

00:20:49.710 --> 00:20:51.100
Um...

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:54.600
She had her head in his lap at one point.

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:55.820
Whoa!

00:20:55.820 --> 00:20:59.130
And then he started stroking her head.

00:21:00.520 --> 00:21:03.990
She even got itchy and started 
scratching around in her bra.

00:21:05.520 --> 00:21:09.530
And right in front of us like it was nothing!

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:13.660
Like a couple who've lived 
together for three years?

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:15.290
Aren't they?

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:19.130
But still, don't you think 
they kind of suit each other?

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:22.140
Mizuto-kun has a mysterious 
quality to him too, right?

00:21:22.140 --> 00:21:25.170
I think he'd do well with 
free-spirited girl like her, no?

00:21:26.120 --> 00:21:28.300
It all depends on how 
you look at it, I guess.

00:21:28.570 --> 00:21:31.320
You'd better keep your wits about you, Yume!

00:21:31.320 --> 00:21:32.180
What?

00:21:32.650 --> 00:21:34.940
You've gotta find yourself a nice boyfriend,

00:21:34.940 --> 00:21:37.440
or else Mizuto-kun's gonna leave you behind.

00:21:37.880 --> 00:21:40.060
Oh, uh... Yeah.

00:21:40.060 --> 00:21:42.810
I mean, just look at how cute you've gotten.

00:21:42.810 --> 00:21:44.620
I'm sure you'll have one in no time!

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:48.740
I don't see it as a competition.

00:21:49.400 --> 00:21:50.920
You'll just have to wait.

00:21:50.920 --> 00:21:52.580
Aw...

00:21:55.690 --> 00:21:59.660
I don't see myself with 
anyone other than Mizuto.

00:22:05.570 --> 00:22:08.970
Did I really say that just now?
